## Mit hlt Bug Fixes
* Timezone Zeit korrekt einstellen auf DCs (Windows interprets hwclock (local time), Linux interprets hwclock (local time) as UTC)
  * Either set america/LA timezone in docker
  * Or set the registry key: `New-ItemProperty -Path 'HKLM:\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\TimeZoneInformation' -Name 'RealTimeIsUniversal' -PropertyType DWord -Value 1 -Force | Out-Null`